# Interactive CAS/Mach/altitude envelope gate for licensed BADA 4.2 data.
# Run with: IC research/pybada-envelope-flight
00:00:00.00>ECHO === PYBADATEM FLIGHT ENVELOPE INTERACTIVE GATE ===
00:00:00.10>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.30>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE FLTR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.10>CRE FLTE,A320-232,41.32,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:02.00>DYNAMICS FLTR TEM
00:00:02.10>DYNAMICS FLTE TEM
00:00:02.20>ENVELOPECHECKS FLTR CUSTOM HIGH_SPEED MACH_MAX ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:02.30>ENVELOPECHECKS FLTE CUSTOM HIGH_SPEED MACH_MAX ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:02.40>ENVELOPE FLTR REPORT
00:00:02.50>ENVELOPE FLTE ENFORCE
00:00:03.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-flight.csv
# The same infeasible speed and altitude targets remain requested under REPORT
# and are atomically limited under ENFORCE.
00:00:04.00>SPD FLTR 600
00:00:04.10>SPD FLTE 600
00:00:05.00>ALT FLTR FL500
00:00:05.10>ALT FLTE FL500
00:00:08.00>PERFSTATUS FLTR
00:00:08.10>PERFSTATUS FLTE
00:00:09.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:09.10>ECHO === EXPECT FLTR REPORT INFEASIBLE WITH UNCHANGED TARGETS ===
00:00:09.20>ECHO === EXPECT FLTE ENFORCE VALID WITH LIMITED TARGETS ===
00:00:10.00>HOLD
